    <string name="rules_title">THE COURT PROTOCOL</string>
    <string name="rules_goal_title">THE GOAL</string>
    <string name="rules_goal_body">Hold the richest districts when the coronation is called on turn eight. Influence is scored every turn from the districts you hold.</string>
    <string name="rules_order_title">HOW TO ORDER</string>
    <string name="rules_order_body">Tap a figure in the tray, tap a district, then tap DEPLOY. You may seal up to two orders per turn, and the rival seals two of its own.</string>
    <string name="rules_bluff_title">BLUFF AND UNMASK</string>
    <string name="rules_bluff_body">A decoy looks exactly like a real order until the flip. UNMASK costs two favor: call a real order and it is stunned, call a decoy and the bluffer collects a favor.</string>
    <string name="rules_figures_title">THE FIVE FIGURES</string>
    <string name="rules_figures_body">Each figure costs favor and brings its own trick to the street.</string>
    <string name="rules_events_title">EVENT CARDS</string>
    <string name="rules_events_body">One card is drawn from the seeded deck at the end of every turn.</string>
    <string name="rules_chains_title">SUPPLY CHAINS</string>
    <string name="rules_chains_body">Three districts you hold in a straight line form a supply chain. Every chain pays two extra favor and two extra influence each turn.</string>
